      "char_start": 33519,
      "char_end": 34311,
      "n_chars": 792,
      "section": "Discrimination at one year and across horizons",
      "first_line_excerpt": "One survival model gave the fused model an AUROC of 0.723 [0.701, 0.745] at 90 days, for onset 31 to 120 days "
    },
